<title>USA: First Industrial buys property in N.J.</title>
<headline>First Industrial buys property in N.J.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc, a real estate investment trust, said Wednesday it acquired a 52,402-square foot light industrial property in Oakland, N.J., for $2,730,000.</p>
<p>This acquisition increases First Industrial's holdings in New Jersey to 17 buildings totaling 856,364 square feet.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
